  "notes": "One-page commercial invoice. The letterhead (organisation name with address lines) and the bottom margin footer are furniture. 'Bill to' / 'Deliver to' and 'Payment instructions' / 'Notes' are two pairs of SIDE-BY-SIDE boxes; reading order is box by box, left box first. Box labels are level-2 headings. The meta table is a key/value table without header row. In the line-item table the label cells of Subtotal, VAT and Total due span four columns (repeated in the grid); the description of DV-14 is a cell of two lines given joined by one space."
